    {
      "id": "t-dense-matrix-d49190",
      "name": "TDenseMatrix",
      "category": "DenseMatrix",
      "signature": "TDenseMatrix(N Rows)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "N Rows",
          "type": ") :"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "A matrix with run-time variable dimensions, up to an element limit defined at compile-time.\nElements are stored in row-major order (i.e., elements in a row are adjacent in memory). Note\nthat FMatrix stores elements in column-major order so that we can access the columns quickly\nwhich is handy when you have rotation matrices and want the spatial axes. We don't care about\nthat so we use the more conventional row-major indexing and matching storage."
    },
